# Rover 100 (R6 facelift), 1994-1998.
#
# The Rover 100 name had been used on the Metro in export markets since 1990; it
# reached Britain with the 1994 facelift, which gave the car a narrow grille slot
# with the Rover badge in a body-coloured nose panel and a dark grey bumper. The
# car was withdrawn in 1998, the last of the Metro line, and its 1997 Euro NCAP
# result made it the byword for the superseded small-car generation.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austin_Metro
#
# Dimensions 3.406 x 1.565 x 1.359 m, wheelbase 2.250 m; unchanged from the Rover
# Metro, whose published dimension box these are.
#
# The three-door body is modelled, as for the Mk2 and the Rover Metro.
#
# Colours: Flame Red (BLVC 818), Tahiti Blue, White Diamond (655) and Silver Leaf
# metallic (421), all Rover UK offerings of the mid-1990s. The split is
# era-adjusted from the 1994-96 measured base: red 5, white 3, blue 2, silver 2.
# Total 12. Provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 135 km/h. Comfort 65/280, on the line 180 + 1.5 x 65, equal to the Corsa B
# and a step above the Rover Metro for the later trim and sound deadening. Classes
# 0,1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence, not production: October 1994 intro, retires staggered
# 2004-2007 on a ten- to thirteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rover-100.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/rover-100.dae (33 objects). Variant of the Rover Metro master;
# references: citycars/references/rover-100/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons,
# CC BY-SA 4.0).
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations, recorded rather than corrected: angular surfaces
# stand in for the photographed rounded corners, and the 1994 nose is modelled as
# the badge slot and grey bumper the photographs show. Stage B ran in connectivity
# mode because the hatch glass sits on the cabin, above the hull's top face.

obj=citycar
name=Rover100(FlameRed)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=5
intro_year=1994
intro_month=10
retire_year=2005
retire_month=6
speed=135
class=0,1
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=65
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=280

Image[E]=./images/rover-100-red_E.0.0,-33,14
